From: "chak-kei.lam" <chak-kei.lam@mediatek.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mt7981: add mtkhnat driver support

6.18 适配：原补丁的 hunk 以上游 6.12 树的 wdma@15104800 /
ap2woccif@151a5000 为上下文，而 6.18 的 mt7981b.dtsi（经
117-complete-mt7981b-dtsi 补全后）没有这两个节点，故整体失败。
改为锚定 ethsys 之后、wed 之前的位置挂载 hnat 节点。
节点默认 disabled，由设备 DTS 启用（见 port/repo）。
---

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7981b.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7981b.dtsi
index 102bdcf..cd07c83 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7981b.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7981b.dtsi
@@ -426,6 +426,15 @@
 			#reset-cells = <1>;
 		};
 
+		hnat: hnat@15000000 {
+			compatible = "mediatek,mtk-hnat_v4";
+			reg = <0 0x15100000 0 0x80000>;
+			resets = <&ethsys 0>;
+			reset-names = "mtketh";
+			mtketh-soc = <&eth>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		wed: wed@15010000 {
 			compatible = "mediatek,mt7981-wed",
 				     "mediatek,mt7986-wed",
